      "description": "Text and arrow joined by a current-color rule; the arrow responds to hover.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-link\" href=\"/me/\">Meet Maksim<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;font-family:var(--font,Onest,sans-serif);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink,#edf0ff);text-decoration:none;padding-bottom:7px;border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;margin-top:25px}.ds-link svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex-shrink:0}.ds-link svg{transition:transform .2s}.ds-link:hover svg{transform:translateX(5px)}.ds-btn:focus-visible,.ds-link:focus-visible,.ds-shutter:focus-visible,.ds-chip:focus-visible,.ds-row:focus-visible,.ds-work:focus-visible,.ds-nav a:focus-visible,.ds-next:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange,#ff895a);outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Main navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "Static real route links with an orange current-page underline; contact disappears on compact layouts.",
      "html": "<header class=\"ds-nav\"><a class=\"ds-brand\" href=\"/\">VAIRY<span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a><nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">Aperto</a><a href=\"/projects/\">Projects</a><a href=\"/me/\">Maksim</a></nav><a class=\"ds-contact\" href=\"mailto:shblknmaks@gmail.com\">Let’s talk<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></a></header>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{height:82px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:36px;padding:0 44px;background:var(--ground,#10132b);color:var(--ink,#edf0ff);font-family:var(--font,Onest,sans-serif)}.ds-nav a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.ds-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:23px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.04em}.ds-brand span{height:7px;width:7px;background:var(--orange,#ff895a)}.ds-nav nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px;margin:auto;font-size:13px}.ds-nav nav a{padding:12px 0}.ds-nav a[aria-current=page]{text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--orange,#ff895a);text-decoration-thickness:2px;text-underline-offset:6px}.ds-nav a:hover{color:var(--orange,#ff895a)}.ds-contact{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;font-size:13px}.ds-nav svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex-shrink:0}.ds-contact svg{width:17px;height:17px}@media(max-width:1100px){.ds-nav{padding:0 30px}}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-nav{height:70px;padding:0 24px;gap:24px}.ds-contact{display:none}.ds-brand{font-size:21px}.ds-nav nav{margin:0 0 0 auto;gap:24px;font-size:12px}}@media(max-width:540px){.ds-nav{height:64px;padding:0 20px;gap:20px}.ds-brand{font-size:19px;gap:7px}.ds-nav nav{gap:19px;font-size:12px}}.ds-btn:focus-visible,.ds-link:focus-visible,.ds-shutter:focus-visible,.ds-chip:focus-visible,.ds-row:focus-visible,.ds-work:focus-visible,.ds-nav a:focus-visible,.ds-next:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange,#ff895a);outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Optical shutter",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "shutter",
      "description": "Actual iris control with hover, press, focus and aria-pressed styling. The live site uses native canvas for its reveal; this snippet demonstrates the CSS control.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-shutter\" aria-label=\"Reveal the color photograph\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"ds-iris\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 80 80\"><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"40\" r=\"29\"/><path d=\"m40 11 17 29-17 29M15 25h34l16 30M15 55l17-30h33\"/></svg></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-shutter{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:0;padding:0;width:90px;height:90px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--orange,#ff895a);color:#2a1730;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 14px 34px #0000004d;transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),background .35s}.ds-shutter:hover{transform:scale(1.08)}.ds-shutter:active{transform:scale(.94)}.ds-iris{display:flex;transform:rotate(0);transition:transform .65s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-iris svg{width:70px;height:70px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-shutter[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--mint,#d0f291)}.ds-shutter[aria-pressed=true] .ds-iris{transform:rotate(60deg)}.ds-shutter:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:default}@media(max-width:1100px){.ds-shutter{width:72px;height:72px}.ds-iris svg{width:56px;height:56px}}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-shutter{width:76px;height:76px}}@media(max-width:540px){.ds-shutter{width:64px;height:64px}.ds-iris svg{width:49px;height:49px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-shutter,.ds-iris{transition:none}}.ds-btn:focus-visible,.ds-link:focus-visible,.ds-shutter:focus-visible,.ds-chip:focus-visible,.ds-row:focus-visible,.ds-work:focus-visible,.ds-nav a:focus-visible,.ds-next:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange,#ff895a);outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Product decision controls",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "decision-chip",
      "description": "Outlined native buttons use aria-pressed; the active decision is cyan.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Tryio product decisions\"><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Start with context</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Let the user lead</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Separate the feedback</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Measure practice</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:42px}.ds-chip{font-family:var(--font,Onest,sans-serif);font-size:12px;color:var(--ink,#edf0ff);background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line,#41496e);padding:13px 17px;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer}.ds-chip[aria-pressed=true]{color:var(--ground,#10132b);background:var(--cyan,#8cd9e6);border-color:var(--cyan,#8cd9e6)}.ds-chip:hover{border-color:var(--cyan,#8cd9e6)}@media(max-width:540px){.ds-chips{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px;margin-bottom:28px}.ds-chip{padding:13px 10px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5}}.ds-btn:focus-visible,.ds-link:focus-visible,.ds-shutter:focus-visible,.ds-chip:focus-visible,.ds-row:focus-visible,.ds-work:focus-visible,.ds-nav a:focus-visible,.ds-next:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange,#ff895a);outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Catalog row and Tryio wordmark",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "project-row",
      "description": "Broad whole-row link with the final 40/28/18px responsive pixel artifact and a left-to-right hover wipe.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-row\" href=\"/tryio/\"><span class=\"ds-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Tryio.</span><div class=\"ds-copy\"><h2>Tryio</h2><p>Practice conversations. Get specific feedback. Try again.</p><span>Historical product case study</span></div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:200px 1fr auto;gap:70px;padding:34px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#41496e);align-items:center;position:relative;isolation:isolate;color:var(--ink,#edf0ff);font-family:var(--font,Onest,sans-serif);text-decoration:none;transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-row::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0 -22px;z-index:-1;background:var(--surface,#1a2040);clip-path:inset(0 100% 0 0);transition:clip-path .55s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-row:hover::before{clip-path:inset(0)}.ds-row:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}.ds-art{height:180px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden;font-family:var(--display,Doto,Onest,sans-serif);font-size:40px;font-weight:700;color:#d2f294;background:#1c2c45}.ds-copy h2{margin:0;font-size:56px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:1.04}.ds-copy p{margin:18px 0 0;color:var(--muted,#b5bde3);font-size:16px;line-height:1.55}.ds-copy>span{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--cyan,#8cd9e6);margin-top:18px}.ds-row svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex-shrink:0}.ds-row>svg{width:38px;height:38px;transition:transform .25s}.ds-row:hover h2{color:var(--orange,#ff895a)}.ds-row:hover>svg{transform:translate(4px,-4px)}@media(max-width:1100px){.ds-row{grid-template-columns:160px 1fr auto;gap:45px}.ds-art{height:160px}}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-row{grid-template-columns:130px 1fr auto;gap:25px}.ds-art{height:150px;font-size:28px}.ds-copy h2{font-size:45px}.ds-copy p{font-size:14px}}@media(max-width:540px){.ds-row{grid-template-columns:78px 1fr 20px;gap:20px;padding:29px 0}.ds-art{height:115px;font-size:18px}.ds-copy h2{font-size:36px}.ds-copy p{font-size:13px;margin-top:13px;line-height:1.5}.ds-copy>span{font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:15px}.ds-row>svg{width:20px;height:20px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-row,.ds-row::before,.ds-row>svg{transition:none}}.ds-btn:focus-visible,.ds-link:focus-visible,.ds-shutter:focus-visible,.ds-chip:focus-visible,.ds-row:focus-visible,.ds-work:focus-visible,.ds-nav a:focus-visible,.ds-next:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange,#ff895a);outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Portfolio work row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "work-row",
      "description": "Product name, concrete facts and directional arrow form a bordered native link.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-work\" href=\"/tryio/\"><div class=\"ds-work-title\"><h3>Tryio</h3><span>Solo journey from idea to App Store</span></div><p>Contextual practice.<br>Specific feedback.<br>Completed sessions as the core metric.</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-work{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr auto;gap:60px;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#41496e);padding:36px 0;position:relative;isolation:isolate;color:var(--ink,#edf0ff);font-family:var(--font,Onest,sans-serif);text-decoration:none;transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-work::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0 -22px;z-index:-1;background:var(--surface,#1a2040);clip-path:inset(0 100% 0 0);transition:clip-path .55s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-work:hover::before{clip-path:inset(0)}.ds-work:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}.ds-work-title h3{margin:0;font-size:48px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:1.04}.ds-work-title span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#b5bde3);display:block;margin-top:15px}.ds-work>p{margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--muted,#b5bde3);line-height:1.8}.ds-work svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex-shrink:0}.ds-work>svg{width:34px;height:34px;transition:transform .25s}.ds-work:hover>svg{transform:translate(4px,-4px)}.ds-work:hover h3{color:var(--orange,#ff895a)}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-work{gap:32px}.ds-work-title h3{font-size:39px}.ds-work>p{font-size:13px}}@media(max-width:540px){.ds-work{grid-template-columns:1fr auto;padding:28px 0;gap:20px}.ds-work-title h3{font-size:42px}.ds-work-title span{font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:13px}.ds-work>p{grid-column:1;grid-row:2;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}.ds-work>svg{grid-column:2;grid-row:1;width:28px;height:28px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-work,.ds-work::before,.ds-work>svg{transition:none}}.ds-btn:focus-visible,.ds-link:focus-visible,.ds-shutter:focus-visible,.ds-chip:focus-visible,.ds-row:focus-visible,.ds-work:focus-visible,.ds-nav a:focus-visible,.ds-next:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange,#ff895a);outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Illustrative conversation study",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "conversation-card",
      "description": "The actual Tryio learning demonstration, explicitly labeled illustrative; live-site text swaps are JavaScript enhancements.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-study\"><div class=\"ds-study-top\"><strong>Coach & Partner</strong><span>Illustrative exchange</span></div><div class=\"ds-messages\"><p class=\"ds-partner\">Hey.</p><p class=\"ds-human\">How’s your day going?</p><div class=\"ds-coach\"><strong>Coach</strong><p>Give them a detail to respond to. Try sharing something about your day, then asking about theirs.</p></div></div><button class=\"ds-next\">Try a more specific reply<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-study{background:#d1f094;color:#1c263d;border-radius:12px;padding:26px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;font-family:var(--font,Onest,sans-serif)}.ds-study-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;font-size:12px;padding-bottom:22px;border-bottom:1px solid #647b486e}.ds-study-top>span{font-size:11px;color:#4c6041}.ds-messages{min-height:305px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;padding:28px 0}.ds-messages>p,.ds-coach{margin:0;padding:15px 18px;border-radius:12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;max-width:87%}.ds-partner{background:#ecf6d2;align-self:flex-start}.ds-human{background:#242e4b;color:#edf3ff;align-self:flex-end}.ds-coach{background:transparent;border:1px solid #667f4a;max-width:100%}.ds-coach strong{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;display:block;margin-bottom:10px}.ds-coach p{margin:0;line-height:1.55}.ds-next{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;width:100%;gap:20px;padding:17px 0 0;border:0;border-top:1px solid #647b486e;background:transparent;color:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer}.ds-next svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex-shrink:0}@media(max-width:1100px){.ds-study{padding:23px}}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-study{max-width:640px}}@media(max-width:540px){.ds-study{padding:21px}.ds-study-top{font-size:11px;gap:14px}.ds-study-top>span{text-align:right}.ds-study-top strong{max-width:100px;line-height:1.5}.ds-messages{min-height:280px;gap:16px;padding:22px 0}.ds-messages>p,.ds-coach{font-size:13px;padding:13px 15px;max-width:91%}.ds-coach{max-width:100%}.ds-next{font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;padding-top:15px}}.ds-btn:focus-visible,.ds-link:focus-visible,.ds-shutter:focus-visible,.ds-chip:focus-visible,.ds-row:focus-visible,.ds-work:focus-visible,.ds-nav a:focus-visible,.ds-next:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange,#ff895a);outline-offset:5px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Pixel Studio",
    "overview": "Pixel Studio makes independent product work feel physical: an indigo optical stage, a lavender maker stage, a warm shutter, a mint learning demonstration, and broad editorial project rows. Doto gives names and selected phrases a pixel texture; Onest carries promises, facts, controls, and reading.\n\nReal product artifacts lead the composition. Full app screens occupy tilted planes, a photograph becomes ASCII, and the shutter opens the photograph from the pointer. Depth comes from perspective, finite arrivals, scroll position, and direct interaction. The approved working Pixel Studio is the authority for this implementation.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Pixel display lettering paired with clear supporting type.",
      "Indigo ground with lavender, orange, mint, cyan, and peach used for distinct roles.",
      "Whole genuine app screens, existing photographs, and explicitly labeled illustrations.",
      "Broad bordered rows, restrained corner rounding, and a circular shutter.",
      "Finite entrances and scroll or pointer-driven depth."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "Artifact Truth",
        "body": "Use genuine product artifacts and existing credited photography. Preserve whole Aperto interfaces; label the Tryio exchange as illustrative.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "Pixel Emphasis",
        "body": "Use Doto for product names and selected expressive phrases. Keep facts, controls, navigation, and reading in Onest.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "Driven Motion",
        "body": "Motion follows entrance, scroll, pointer, or a deliberate action. Do not add perpetual float loops or public motion settings; honor the operating system preference.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do preserve the approved Pixel Studio composition and the distinct optical, maker, and learning stages.",
      "Do show the entire raw Aperto interface with contain sizing and the existing phone proportions.",
      "Do keep real navigation and content usable without JavaScript.",
      "Do use the source breakpoints and preserve the Tryio catalog wordmark at 40px, 28px, and 18px.",
      "Do keep keyboard focus visible and respect operating system reduced motion.",
      "Do preserve pending beta status until a real public URL is provided and verified.",
      "Do keep Tryio illustrations labeled, its closed experiment status explicit, and product claims grounded in evidence."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't introduce AI-generated photography, fabricated screenshots, or App Store poster crops.",
      "Don't imply that the credited demo photographs were shot with Aperto.",
      "Don't add perpetual floating animations, visible motion toggles, or motion settings.",
      "Don't convert the static routes into PJAX, an SPA, or a View Transition navigation system.",
      "Don't invent active store access, growth results, validated confidence improvement, or engineering employment.",
      "Don't use the registration-speed reduction claim as an achievement.",
      "Don't treat the inherited buildPath=comp setting as evidence of a generated comp for this implementation."
    ]
  }
}

